                "markdown": "**Misconfiguration KSV004**\n| Type | Severity | Check | Message | Link |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n|Kubernetes Security Check|LOW|Default capabilities: some containers do not drop any|Container 'order' of 'deployment' 'order-service-lab' in 'default' namespace should set securityContext.capabilities.drop|[KSV004](http./03-cloud-native-lab best practices require containers to run with minimal required capabilities."
